  "body": "## sqly v1.7.4\n\nRun SQL over CSV, TSV, LTSV, JSON, JSONL, Parquet, Excel, ACH, Fedwire, and\nsupported compressed inputs (.gz, .bz2, .xz, .zst, .z, .snappy, .s2, .lz4).\n\nInstall or upgrade, then see the grouped highlights below. Every artifact is\nsigned and ships with an SBOM and build provenance — see\n[Verify a release](https://nao1215.github.io/sqly/install/#verify-a-release).\n\n## Changelog\n### Documentation\n* 6cb75bdea7f0eb75ac8db157460f35bf49bdab46: docs: point release verification links at the install page (@nao1215)\n### Others\n* 32b691ad909a5b2aa911ee2d70db49e37a6df504: build(deps): consolidate updates and fix maintenance checks (#1038) (@nao1215)\n* 592eb8ccd74e4263f79f7bdf2ec8360c723ee42c: build(deps): update dependencies and raise the Go floor to 1.26.9 for new stdlib advisories (@nao1215)\n* da3298fefed5923b76dcd38ce7bf0a9e1aa67aaa: build(deps): update deps, Go floor 1.26.10, bundle dependency licenses (#1029) (@nao1215)\n* eacc7d88ac589fb08904917b1eae76e5b37b6aeb: build(deps): update filesql to v0.60.1 and excelize to v2.11.1 (#1046) (@nao1215)\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/nao1215/sqly/compare/v1.7.3...v1.7.4\n\n",
